# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Leverage trim SQD for improved configuration selection"
msgstr "Trim SQD für eine verbesserte Konfigurationsauswahl nutzen"

